{"id":"n74824-1-8","stage":5,"title":"센서 · 传感器","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74824-1-8-1","ko":"센서가 울리는 게 아무래도 불이 난 것 같아요.","zh":"传感器响了，恐怕着火了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"센서가","meaning":"传感器，感应器","explanation":"센서：传感器，感应器；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"센서","audio":"/audio/e8b0f084e4743e272141.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74824","senseId":"1","lemma":"센서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"센서가","audio":"/audio/c6a6bf2df97e2a31c5dc.mp3"}},{"text":"울리는","meaning":"鸣","explanation":"울리다：鸣；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"울리다","audio":"/audio/c85644d57a245a82d303.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26702","senseId":"3","lemma":"울리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"울리는","audio":"/audio/96af1e9846d847679d9d.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"아무래도","meaning":"到底，还是","explanation":"아무래도：到底，还是","readings":[{"term":"아무래도","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71330","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아무래도","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3"}},{"text":"불이","meaning":"火灾","explanation":"불：火灾；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"불","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61154","senseId":"3","lemma":"불","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불이","audio":"/audio/9312b03715e82a6ac161.mp3"}},{"text":"난","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7",